OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies demand answers over
OL,4,AVincent Chan complaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies affected by a former nursery
OL,7,Fworker who sexually abused young
OL,8,Fchildren in his care want an
OL,9,Finvestigation after learning he was
OL,10,Fallowed to return to work despite a
OL,11,Fcomplaint having been made against him.
OL,13,FVincent Chan, who worked at Bright
OL,14,FHorizons nursery in Barnet, north-west
OL,15,FLondon, between 2017 and 2024, was
OL,16,Fjailed for 18 years in February after
OL,17,Fadmitting 56 sexual offences.
OL,19,FConcerns about him were raised in 2021,
OL,20,Faccording to reports. The nature of the
OL,21,Fcomplaint has not been made public.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
